      "side": 1,
      "message": "let\u0027s not introduce new structs with TODO.\ni\u0027m trying to figure out why `reserved[3]` historically made sense\nand how it would make sense now for V3.\nwe can\u0027t \"fix\" existing in-use definitions, but\ncan we just drop it for V3? this whole struct is `packed` anyway, and\nmaking assumptions about adding 3 bytes of padding here making\nthe next field naturally aligned for optimization\nseems overly optimistic and fragile.",
